    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yɛp-ta kɛnɛ ji̱ Ɛ-pa-rim",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu ji̱ Ɛ-pa-rim rɔ dol, kä cukɛ jiɛth kui̱c wäkɛ kä Dha-pon kä cua Yɛp-ta jiök i̱, “Ɛŋu curi jiɛth kui̱c ɔ wi̱i̱ nyiëëny kɛ ji̱ Am-on, kä /keni kɔ cɔl kɛɛl kɛ ji̱? Kɔn ba̱kɔ duelu cua̱th wi̱i̱du kɛ mac.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Yɛp-ta kɛ loc i̱, “Ɣän kɔnɛ nɛɛkä ta̱kɔ ko̱o̱r mi di̱i̱t kɛ ji̱ Am-on. Ɛ cäŋ cä yɛ cɔl, /cia̱ dëë kään tetädiɛn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mëë ca ŋa̱c i̱ /cia̱ dëë kän, cua̱ tëkdä cu la̱th tetädä, cua̱ cu jiɛth kui̱c nyiëënyä kɛ ji̱ Am-on. Kä cu Kuoth Nhial kɛ cu ka̱mä. Kuɛ la ŋu bä yɛn kä ɣä mɔ walɛ bia ben nyiëëny kɛ ɣä mɔ?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛ jɛn cu Yɛp-ta ji̱ Gil-yad diaal mat kä cukɛ nyiëëny kɛ ji̱ Ɛ-pa-rim. Kä cuɛ ji̱ Ɛ-pa-rim joc, kɛ ɣöö cikɛ ji̱ Gil-yad, jiök i̱, “Kɛ yɛn tɛ̈ɛ̈m kä ji̱ Ɛ-pa-rim kɛnɛ ji̱ Ma-na-thɛ.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu ji̱ Gil-yad thuk wäthni kiɛɛr Jɔr-dɛn dhɔ̱ŋ kä ji̱ Ɛ-pa-rim. Kä mɔ ci bar ji̱ Ɛ-pa-rim wee, “A ɣä jiathä kui̱c ɔ.” Bi ji̱ Gil-yad ɛ jiök i̱, “Ɛ ji̱n raan Ɛ-pa-rim?” Mi cɛ wee “Eey,” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ba jiök i̱, “Kä wëri Ci-bo-lɛth,” bɛ wee, “Thi-bo-lɛth,” kɛ ɣöö /cɛ jɛ luäŋ kɛ lär. Ɛn wa̱nɔ bikɛ jɛ cu ŋot thok waath kiɛɛr Jɔr-dɛn. Cua nɛy ti bathdɔɔri ti jiɛn ŋuaan wi̱cdɛ rɛw kä ji̱ Ɛ-pa-rim näk.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.12.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu Yɛp-ta I-thɛ-rɛl ruac kɛ run bäkɛl. Kä cuɛ cu li̱w, kä cua jɛ kony wi̱i̱dɛ kä Gil-yad.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.12.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ib-dhan kɛnɛ Ee-lon kɛ Ab-don",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ kɔrɛ cu Ib-dhan raan Beth-lɛ-ɣɛm I-thɛ-rɛl ruac. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä jɛn tëë kɛ dhɔɔl ti jiɛn diɔ̱k. Kɛ nyi̱er ti jiɛn diɔ̱k ti cɛ jak kä kuɛnkɛ ɛ nɛy ti /ci tɔ̱a̱ ji̱ maarädɛ kä cuɛ gaatkɛ kuën nyi̱er ti jiɛn diɔ̱k ti /ci maar kɛ jɛ. Cuɛ I-thɛ-rɛl ruac kɛ run bärɔw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu Ib-dhan li̱w kä cua jɛ kony kä Beth-lɛ-ɣɛm.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.12.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä kɛ kɔrɛ cu ruëc ni Ee-lon raan Dhɛ-bu-lun kä I-thɛ-rɛl. Cuɛ ruëc kɛ run wäl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Ee-lon li̱w, kä cua jɛ kony kä A-ya-lon ro̱o̱l Dhɛ-bu-lun.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.12.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ kɔrɛ cu ruëc ni Ab-don gat Ɣi-lel raan Pi-ra-thon kä I-thɛ-rɛl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cuɛ tekɛ gaat ti jiɛn ŋuaan, kɛ gaat döödɛ ti jiɛn diɔ̱k, ti la kɔatkɛ muɔ̱li ti jiɛn da̱ŋ bärɔw. Kä cuɛ I-thɛ-rɛl ruac kɛ run bädäk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.12.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛ jɛn cu Ab-don li̱w, kä cua jɛ kony kä Pi-ra-thon ro̱o̱l ji̱ Ɛ-pa-rim, dhɔr päämni ji̱ Ä-ma-lek.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.12.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
